A small number of monsters can curse and destroy armor, so those
few monsters are able to do damage even if your AC is -127.  For
them no amount of improving AC helps.  For the rest, get your AC
big enough and even balrogs aren't much of a hassle.  But again,
above some subjective point it will feel like more AC helps for fewer
and fewer of the meanest monsters.

And eventually you'll value a screen of trivial monsters like herzous
and pit fiends* more than another AC point.  You can always wade
through them killing as you go while the more powerfull monsters
have to move randomly in a crowd.  *Especially if you are able to
make acid blobs or insects at will.



